{{- define "messages" -}}
{{- if .Errors }}
> [!CAUTION]
> **The request did not pass validation.** Edit the issue body (keep the `###` headings) to fix:
{{- range .Errors }}
> - {{ safe . }}
{{- end }}
{{ end -}}
{{- if .Warnings }}
> [!WARNING]
{{- range .Warnings }}
> - {{ safe . }}
{{- end }}
{{ end -}}
{{- end -}}

{{- define "rules" -}}
{{- if .AutoApproved }}
No approval is required by policy{{ if .Plan.AutoApproved }} (auto-approval conditions met){{ end }}. The request executes as soon as you comment `.submit`.
{{- else }}
| Approval rule | Needed | Who can approve |
| ------------- | ------ | --------------- |
{{- range .Rules }}
| {{ cell .Name }} | {{ .Min }} | {{ cell .Who }} |
{{- end }}
{{- if .Plan.Escalations }}

Policy escalations applied: {{ range $i, $e := .Plan.Escalations }}{{ if $i }}; {{ end }}{{ safe $e }}{{ end }}.
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .Plan.Environment }}

Execution runs in the GitHub environment {{ code .Plan.Environment }}{{ if not .AutoApproved }}, which can add a required-reviewer gate{{ end }}.
{{- end }}
{{- end -}}

{{- define "approval-progress" -}}
{{- with .Approval }}
| Approval rule | Progress | Approved by |
| ------------- | -------- | ----------- |
{{- range .Rules }}
| {{ cell .Name }} | {{ len .Approvers }} / {{ .Min }}{{ if eq .Missing 0 }} ✅{{ end }} | {{ range $i, $a := .Approvers }}{{ if $i }}, {{ end }}{{ safe $a.User }} ({{ cell $a.Reason }}){{ else }}—{{ end }} |
{{- end }}
{{- if .Ignored }}

Votes that did not count:
{{- range .Ignored }}
- {{ safe .User }}: {{ safe .Reason }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end -}}

{{- define "questions" -}}
{{- with .QA }}
| # | Question | Answer | Status |
| - | -------- | ------ | ------ |
{{- range .Questions }}
| {{ .ID }} | {{ cell .Text }}{{ if not .Required }} _(optional)_{{ end }} | {{ if .Answered }}{{ cell (trunc 120 .Answer) }}{{ if .FromDefault }} _(default)_{{ end }}{{ else }}—{{ end }} | {{ if .Error }}⚠️ {{ cell .Error }}{{ else if .Answered }}✅{{ else if .Required }}needed{{ else }}optional{{ end }} |
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end -}}

{{- define "answer-howto" -}}
Reply with a comment that starts with `.answers` and one `A<number>:` line per answer. Multi-line answers continue on the following lines; later answers replace earlier ones; `skip` leaves an optional question blank.

```text
.answers
{{- range .QA.Questions }}
A{{ slice .ID 1 }}: {{ if .Choices }}<one of: {{ join ", " .Choices }}>{{ else if .Default }}{{ .Default }}{{ else }}...{{ end }}
{{- end }}
```
{{- end -}}

{{- define "spec" -}}
{{- with .Result }}
<details><summary>Task specification sent to the agent (digest <code>{{ short .Digest }}</code>)</summary>

