**Objective**

{{ safe .Objective }}

**Acceptance criteria**
{{ range .AcceptanceCriteria }}
- {{ safe . }}
{{- end }}

**Answers**
{{ range .SortedAnswerKeys }}
- {{ code . }}: {{ safe (index $.Result.Answers .) }}
{{- end }}

</details>
{{- end }}
{{- end -}}

